    "abstract": "Abstract\r\n\r\nPatient counseling is essential for improving medication adherence, but its effectiveness is often limited by time and patient recall. This project evaluates the use of QR code technology to enhance counseling by providing patients with easy access to drug information, including dosage, side effects, and instructions.\r\nQR codes linked to digital resources were given to patients along with their medications. A questionnaire assessed patient knowledge and adherence before and after the intervention. Results showed improved understanding, better adherence, and higher patient satisfaction.\r\nIn conclusion, QR code–based counseling is a simple, cost-effective approach that improves patient engagement and supports better therapeutic outcomes.",
