    "originalTitle": "PMS: Development of an Enhanced Pharmacy Management System for Improved Patient Care and Pharmacy Operations",
    "abstract": "The Pharmacy Management System (PMS) is a comprehensive software solution designed to streamline pharmacy operations, optimize inventory management, and enhance patient safety. This project aims to develop an advanced version of the traditional PMS, incorporating improved add-ons that cater specifically to the needs of pharmacists. The system not only facilitates the management of drug stock, sales, and prescriptions but also provides pharmacists with smart features like drug interaction alerts, dosage guidelines, patient medication history, and controlled substance monitoring.\r\nBy integrating clinical decision support tools and automated alerts for stock levels and expiry dates, the system enhances the efficiency and accuracy of daily pharmacy tasks. Furthermore, the inclusion of patient counseling logs and real-time prescription validation ensures better patient care and supports pharmacists’ decision-making.\r\nThe project seeks to empower pharmacists with a system that goes beyond basic transactional functionalities, ultimately improving medication safety, inventory control, and patient outcomes. This enhanced PMS will not only benefit pharmacy staff but also contribute to higher standards of healthcare delivery through advanced technology-driven solutions.",
