    "abstract": "Wazwan is a wellness-oriented social space designed to provide individuals, friends, and families with a calm, non-clinical environment where they can relax, de-stress, and engage in wellness activities. The project aims to create accessible urban wellness spaces that promote healthier lifestyles through private relaxation pods, curated refreshments, mindfulness programs, and optional support from certified wellness professionals.The business model combines wellness hospitality with community engagement by offering private and semi-private relaxation spaces, wellness sessions, meditation classes, and partnerships with universities, corporates, and wellness brands. Through a strategic three-level planning framework—strategic, tactical, and operational wazwan seeks to establish itself as a trusted urban wellness brand in Pakistan. The long-term vision includes opening multiple branches, launching digital booking systems, and expanding institutional wellness programs.This project addresses the growing need for stress-relief spaces in urban areas by blending comfort, privacy, and evidence-informed wellness solutions, making mental and emotional wellbeing more approachable and socially acceptable.",
