    "abstract": "Vomi-Choc: a disruptive nutraceutical innovation designed to bridge the \"Compliance Gap\" by replacing bitter anti-emetic syrups with a palatable, lipid-shielded delivery system. Utilizing an anhydrous, 70% dark chocolate matrix, the formulation encapsulates standardized Ginger (*Zingiber officinale) extract and *Pyridoxine (Vitamin B6), leveraging thermosensitive lipid-masking* to bypass salivary bitterness and metallic taste (dysgeusia). This entrepreneurial model targets the pervasive \"Syrup Struggle\" in Pakistan, providing a shelf-stable, clinical-grade alternative that ensures bio-active gingerols are released effectively in the gastric pH without the rejection reflex. By integrating a dual-segment strategy that serves both the General Patient Population (inclusive of pediatric and adult care) and the Oncology Care Line, Vomi-Choc transitions the patient experience from a stressful medical encounter to a \"Gentle Dose,\" offering a scalable, high-margin business framework for independent pharmaceutical entrepreneurs.",
