    "originalTitle": "BlissBites: Healthy Habits Start with Healthy Snacking — From Concept to Market Launch",
    "abstract": "BlissBites: Healthy Habits Start with Healthy Snacking is a nutritious seed-bar brand developed to provide a healthier alternative to regular snacks. The bars are prepared using a combination of nutrient-rich seeds such as melon seeds, flaxseeds, sunflower seeds, and chia seeds, which are known for their benefits in supporting heart health, digestion, immunity, energy, and overall wellness. After successfully formulating the product, the next step of the project focuses on marketing BlissBites in a way that makes healthy snacking attractive, convenient, and easy to adopt for students, young adults, and health-conscious consumers. The marketing strategy for BlissBites in the short term, will focus on creating awareness and encouraging trial among the target audience. This will be done through attractive packaging, product sampling, small promotional stalls, social media posts, student-centered campaigns, and word-of-mouth marketing. Platforms such as Instagram, TikTok, and WhatsApp will be used to share short videos, customer reviews, behind-the-scenes preparation, health benefits, and catchy snack-related content.In the long term, the goal will be to build BlissBites as a recognizable healthy snack brand. This can be achieved by improving brand identity, introducing more flavors, collaborating with gyms, cafés, university canteens, nutritionists, and wellness influencers, and expanding sales through online platforms. The brand can also focus on eco-friendly packaging, customized seed bars, subscription snack boxes, and awareness campaigns related to healthy eating habits. By combining health benefits with creative and engaging marketing, BlissBites aims to position itself not only as a snack product, but as a lifestyle choice for people who want to eat better without compromising taste or convenience.",
