    "abstract": "Many patients lack proper counselling regarding the safe and effective use of medicines, which often results in incorrect dosing, misuse, early discontinuation of therapy, and poor awareness of disease management and drug-related risks. Additionally, the widespread use of unverified online sources has increased the chances of medication errors and health complications. \r\nSehat Guide aims to educate the general public, elderly patients, caregivers, and healthcare students about the proper use of medicines, disease awareness, and toxicity-related concerns. Key content areas include medicine counselling (with emphasis on disease and toxicity), disease awareness, pharmacy tips, and short educational videos for quick learning.",
