    "originalTitle": "Gumella Teething Relief Oral Dissolving Film",
    "abstract": "Background:\r\n\r\nInfant teething causes gum inflammation, irritation, and discomfort, often affecting feeding and sleep. Conventional treatments like topical gels provide only temporary relief due to rapid salivary wash-out and may contain synthetic agents with safety concerns. Therefore, there is a need for safer, natural, and more effective delivery systems that provide sustained relief in infants.\r\n\r\nHypothesis:\r\n\r\nAn absorbable, natural-based oral film formulated with safe soothing agents will provide more effective and sustained relief from infant teething discomfort compared to conventional topical gels, by improving retention time in the oral cavity and reducing rapid salivary wash-out while ensuring safety and ease of use.\r\n\r\nObjective:\r\n\r\nThe objective of this study was to develop an innovative oral dissolving film (ODF) using natural anti-inflammatory agents to provide sustained, localized relief. We hypothesized that a film-based delivery system using a solvent casting method would provide a safer, more hygienic, and more accurate dosing alternative to traditional gels\r\n\r\nMethodology:\r\n\r\nThe “Gumella” film was prepared using the solvent casting method. The formulation integrates natural bioactive extracts, specifically Chamomile and Aloe Vera, selected for their cooling, anti-inflammatory, and healing properties. The film was designed to dissolve rapidly upon contact with the oral mucosa, releasing these natural ingredients directly onto the affected gum tissue\r\n\r\nResult:\r\n\r\nThe resulting formulation is a thin, innovative oral film that ensures accurate dosing and improved hygiene for pediatric administration. By replacing harmful anesthetic drugs with natural extracts, the film achieves a soothing effect without the risks associated with synthetic chemicals. The fast-dissolving nature of the film addresses the limitation of “salivary wash-out” seen in traditional products\r\n\r\nConclusion:\r\n\r\nOverall, the “Gumella” oral dissolving film represents a modern and effective approach to infant teething relief. This project demonstrates that natural phytopharmaceuticals can be successfully delivered via ODF technology to provide a safe alternative to conventional pediatric dental treatments",
