    "abstract": "This study developed and evaluated a herbal emulgel containing extracts of Piper nigrum and Curcuma longa for the management of Vitiligo. Six formulations (F1–F6) were prepared using Carbopol 934, Carbopol 940, and HPMC K4M as gelling agents. The formulations were evaluated for pH, viscosity, spreadability, homogeneity, and in-vitro drug release. Among them, F4 containing Carbopol 934 showed optimal properties with suitable pH, good spreadability, and sustained release of piperine and curcumin, indicating its suitability as a stable and effective topical herbal emulgel",
