    "abstract": "BioHerbal Relief Powder is a polyherbal formulation designed to provide natural relief from constipation, menstrual pain, and mild urinary discomfort. It contains flaxseed (Alsi), papaya leaf, fenugreek (Methi), and fennel (Saunf). Flaxseed and fenugreek act as bulk-forming laxatives that improve bowel movement and help reduce straining in hemorrhoids. Fennel helps relieve menstrual cramps due to its antispasmodic effect and also supports urinary tract health through its mild diuretic action, while papaya leaf aids digestion and provides anti-inflammatory benefits.\r\nOverall, this formulation offers a safe, natural, and multi-functional approach for digestive, urinary, and menstrual health with minimal side effects.",
