    "abstract": "This study focuses on the formulation of a zero-glycemic synbiotic suspension syrup designed specifically for geriatric diabetic patients to support gut health without affecting blood glucose levels. The developed formulation combines prebiotics and probiotics in a stable aqueous suspension and was evaluated for physicochemical properties, microbial viability, and biochemical stability. Results indicate that the synbiotic syrup maintains probiotic activity while ensuring glycemic neutrality, suggesting its potential as a supportive nutraceutical for elderly diabetic care.",
