    "faculty": "Pharmacy",
    "department": "Pharmaceutics",
    "courseCode": "PHM-409",
    "courseTitle": "Quality Management",
    "supervisor": "Zoya Amin",
    "originalTitle": "Post Covid long term morbidities in Pakistan",
    "abstract": "Post-COVID syndrome (Long COVID)\r\nrefers to symptoms that persist after\r\nrecovery from acute COVID-19 infection.\r\nIn Pakistan, many recovered patients\r\nexperience long-term health issues\r\naffecting multiple systems. These\r\ncomplications highlight the need for\r\nproper follow-up care and healthcare",
